# Build output. `npm run build` wipes public/ and re-emits it from frontend/,
# with fresh content hashes every time. Committing it meant Vercel checked out
# one set of hashed chunks, globbed them for the function bundle, then had the
# build delete them out from under it -- ENOENT on a file that existed at
# checkout. The static assets that are NOT generated live in frontend/public/,
# which Vite copies into dist/, so nothing is lost by ignoring this.
# Anchored with a leading slash so frontend/public/ stays tracked.
/public/
